{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Cindy.Cindy","latestVersion":"0.1.130","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.ee7a7da3.png","priority":1,"sha256":"ee7a7da3d3630ca761074d163b53b10f073aff7ce375e76a9affc8a18e1ba3a9","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent：想到，就能做到。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Cindy 是一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent。她把多套 Harness、模型和工具收进同一个持续成长的伙伴，在真实工程和软件里把任务做完。一开始就好用，任你打扮，任你培养。\nCindy 运行在你自己的电脑上，使用你本地的文件和已登录的应用。首批兼容 Claude Code 与 Codex 两套 Agent Harness，更多 Harness 正在接入。模型与 Harness 自由组合、同一任务中随时切换，工作现场、记忆、Skill 和工具始终连续；一个任务还可以由不同 Harness 与模型组合的多个 agent 规划、并行执行、独立 review。","releaseNotes":"Desktop release 0.1.130\n更新说明\n🤖 Claude 订阅可选 Fable 5.2\nClaude 订阅账号现在能在模型列表里选到最新的 Fable 5.2，并保留 Fast 模式；在设置里刷新模型列表时，也会等待实际刷新完成再显示结果。 @dashhuang\n🛠️ Android 输入框闪退修复\n在 Android 上新建任务后点击输入框会直接闪退，现已修复；输入框可以正常聚焦并输入文字。 @guyong-zapo\n📱 Android 用量小组件字体修正\nAndroid 的订阅余量与每日用量小组件现在使用设计好的数字字体，数字显示更紧凑清晰。 @guyong-zapo\nPRs\n#6609 #6752 #6771 #7284 #8439 #8653 #8655 #9031 #9204 #9205 #9226 #9246 #9282 #9312 #9313 #9320 #9325 #9330 #9337 #9338 #9375 #9383 #9384 #9392 #9410 #9413 #9415 #9417 #9425 #9428 #9430 #9432 #9438 #9439 #9442 #9443 #9445 #9446 #9447 #9448 #9449 #9456 #9457 #9468 #9475 #9477 #9480 #9481 #9487 #9493 #9495 #9497 #9498 #9499 #9502 #9503 #9507 #9509 #9512 #9514 #9516 #9522 #9523 #9524 #9528 #9529 #9533 #9540 #9541 #9554\n\n- commit: 999f7b8b415b17d246acaed7fe07880439fcaf72\n- source tag: beta2026-11-10_15-36-19\n- regions: cn global\n- iOS(cn):整包 0.1.24(2026110601) · 热更 ae8bec7a\n- Android(cn):整包 0.1.35(48) · 热更 66625750\n- iOS(global):整包 0.1.24(2026110601) · 热更 65cdcf88\n- Android(global):整包 0.1.35(41) · 热更 1aae8b2b","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.130","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.130/app.json","detailSha256":"0da58c36dc84e9a79337a48c1d44c8a7ab2c881fc5ed3d7bea81bb3a696a777d","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.130"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.128/app.json","detailSha256":"4a7b03a40fc76f483286986c6581be12cab1697bf4ffce48467ec618c99fc291","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.128"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.126/app.json","detailSha256":"d04034aee63516ef542f4cf7ce0f8bf3f6c8c199a1f1eb61e6bcd8ee6b8cfd92","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.126"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.125/app.json","detailSha256":"c7c54d3c63dc2d30489fbe67b1446827ff8ff5f844bf50a3a7584e9b5029d483","releaseDate":"2026-11-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.125"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.124/app.json","detailSha256":"8b455c7b2f241772c79cba8bfa6a3e0793fc95619a8d7478b2bb13c0a8a33819","releaseDate":"2026-11-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.124"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.121/app.json","detailSha256":"91ea54c6d5409bd17d80caa3e4599b08dd37ba3eb79f3851061b2a96239eeb5a","releaseDate":"2026-10-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.121"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.120/app.json","detailSha256":"3771efe40f14a7dfb3fd1ce74cda34928a557b1f37339d57fbe068e1f988e778","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.120"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.119